cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Anima Engine in your research or build on it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Anima Engine"
abstract: >-
  A real-time artificial-life and evolution simulator: terrain, water, climate,
  soil, plants and animals, and the knock-on effects between those systems,
  inside a Tauri v2 desktop app. Creatures develop from a genotype-encoded
  morphology and can carry evolved per-agent brains. The simulation core is
  Rust (Bevy ECS + Burn); the presentation layer is React + TypeScript.
authors:
